  "ingredients": [
    "27 ounce canned coconut milk (chilled, liquid discarded)",
    "1/2 cup almond butter",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "4 ounce low-carb dark chocolate (chopped)",
    "1 cup almond flour",
    "2 tablespoon coconut flour",
    "2 tablespoon erythritol",
    "1 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoon ghee",
    "2 tablespoon water",
    "2 tablespoon slivered almonds"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan, heat the coconut cream, almond butter, vanilla, and larger amount sweetener listed until they are completely melted together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat and stir in the chocolate until the chocolate is melted and the mixture is smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refrigerate the mixture while you prepare the crust.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Whisk or sift the flours, smaller amount of sweetener listed, xanthan gum, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a fork, cut in the ghee until the mixture is crumbly and beginning to resemble dough.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beginning with half the water, knead into dough. If it’s looking dry, add more water a small amount at a time, until the mixture is sticky to the touch.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press evenly into a pie tin and bake for about 15 minutes or until the edges start to brown. Be careful not to burn. Remove and let cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the crust is cooled, pour the chocolate filling into the pie tin and place in the freezer for at least 4 hours or refrigerate overnight.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with slivered almonds before slicing. Serve cold and refrigerate any leftovers!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-chocolate-silk-pie/#wprm-recipe-52774-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
